      "description": "IntervalBeep is a clean, focused interval timer that beeps at set intervals so you can concentrate on what matters.\n\n  Set a total time and an interval, IntervalBeep handles the rest. A clear beep sounds at every interval, a\n  distinct sound marks the start, and a final tone lets you know you're done. No complicated setup, no clutter.\n\n  SIMPLE TO USE\n  - Set your total time (hours, minutes, seconds)\n  - Set your interval\n  - Press Start, that's it\n\n  CUSTOMIZABLE SOUNDS\n  - Choose from 12 musical notes for each sound\n  - Configure start, interval, and end sounds separately\n  - Set note duration (short, medium, long)\n  - Up to 3 notes per sound\n  - Preview sounds before you start\n\n  WORKS IN THE BACKGROUND\n  - Timer keeps running when your screen is locked\n  - Audio signals play reliably in the background\n  - Optional haptic feedback\n\n  BEAUTIFUL DESIGN\n  - Dual progress rings show total and interval time at a glance\n  - Dark interface for comfortable use in any environment\n  - Clean typography with color-coded counters\n  - Responsive layout for iPhone and iPad\n\n  USE IT FOR ANYTHING\n  - Workout intervals and HIIT training\n  - Cooking and baking\n  - Study sessions and pomodoro technique\n  - Meditation and breathing exercises\n  - Presentations and public speaking practice\n  - Music practice and rehearsals\n\n  ONE-TIME PURCHASE\n  No subscriptions. No ads. No in-app purchases. Pay once, use forever.",
